            "review_text": "Sara G\n4 contributions\n0\nAmazing, reccomended!!\nAug 2025\nAmazing experience! We started with some beers at the bar upstairs while playing darts and since we were really enjoying the place we went down at the yakitori restaurant to have dinner which succeeded our expectations! The food is simply delicious, the staff is so nice, Hana treated us so well!!!\nWe completely reccomend this restaurant, we will come back!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 8, 2025",
