            "review_text": "Hanna\nCon Son, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nAka Ryu Izakaya\nMay 2025 • Friends\nI read review on gg and come to try , don’t have too much expectation. But the smelling the skewers grilled too fragrant, surprised by the taste of the Japanese flavor of the izayaka restaurant, and the service staff was very friendly. Highly recommend skewers for who finding some Japanese food with beer , and i love the anime decoration here.\nWritten June 18, 2025\n𝑨𝑲𝑨 𝑹𝒀𝑼 𝒀𝑨𝑲𝑰𝑻𝑶𝑹𝑰 & 𝑩𝑨𝑹\nThank you for your kind review and great experience at our restaurant. We look forward to serving you again soon!\n----------------------------\n𝑨𝑲𝑨 𝑹𝒀𝑼 𝒀𝑨𝑲𝑰𝑻𝑶𝑹𝑰 & 𝑩𝑨𝑹 - 𝑮𝒓𝒐𝒖𝒏𝒅 𝑭𝒍𝒐𝒐𝒓 \n𝑨𝑲𝑨 𝐇𝐈𝐃𝐃𝐄𝐍 𝐁𝐀𝐑 - 𝑺𝒆𝒄𝒐𝒏𝒅 𝑭𝒍𝒐𝒐𝒓 \n𝟔𝟗 𝐂𝐚́𝐜𝐡 𝐌𝐚̣𝐧𝐠 𝐓𝐡𝐚́𝐧𝐠 𝟖 - 𝐁𝐞̂́𝐧 𝐓𝐡𝐚̀𝐧𝐡 - 𝐐𝐮𝐚̣̂𝐧 𝟏 \n𝐇𝐨𝐭𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐞 : 𝟎𝟗𝟑𝟐 𝟏𝟏𝟏 𝟖𝟕𝟕\nRead more\nWritten June 24, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
